{"format":"hologram.registry.artifact/v1","id":"docker.io/grafana/grafana-enterprise","fetched":"2026-09-25T12:09:36.899Z","source":{"name":"Docker Hub","api":"https://hub.docker.com/v2/repositories/grafana/grafana-enterprise/","page":"https://hub.docker.com/r/grafana/grafana-enterprise"},"readme":"# Grafana Enterprise Docker Image\n\nGrafana Enterprise is the recommended distribution of Grafana. It works great without a license, and can easily be upgraded to enable Enterprise features like data source permissions, reporting, and extended auth options. \n\n## Running your Grafana container\n\nStart your container binding the external port `3000`.\n\n```bash\ndocker run -d --name=grafana -p 3000:3000 grafana/grafana-enterprise\n```\n\n## Changelog\n\nYou can find information about Grafana in our [docs](https://grafana.com/docs/), or find out what's new in the latest release [here](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/latest/whatsnew/)!","readmeBase":null,"publisher":{"name":"grafana","url":"https://hub.docker.com/u/grafana","official":false,"verified":false},"registered":"2018-10-16T15:29:41.191343Z","updated":"2026-09-15T09:27:06.359181Z","categories":["Security","Integration & delivery","Monitoring & observability"],"keywords":[],"license":null,"links":[],"maintainers":[],"stats":{"pulls":24295517,"stars":47},"mediaTypes":["application/vnd.docker.container.image.v1+json","application/vnd.docker.distribution.manifest.list.v2+json"],"contentTypes":["image"],"storage":16484764899741,"tags":[{"name":"13.0.9-boringcrypto-distroless-slim","digest":"sha256:820771320cc47dd2258a64d17139dab108ef5f050825931add95ac5dafee842f","pushed":"2026-09-15T09:27:06.165959Z","size":350577105,"platforms":["linux/amd64"],"mediaType":"application/vnd.docker.distribution.manifest.list.v2+json","status":"active"},{"name":"13.0.9-boringcrypto","digest":"sha256:2a83ff358c7bda757c436af26cdcea0b8fe2224ca4da04b0ca7228f30f9cdb31","pushed":"2026-09-15T09:26:52.732331Z","size":379168483,"platforms":["lin